    historyContent: {
      origins: "Kontra belongs to the Jass family of games that originated in Switzerland and spread across Europe. The Finnish variant developed with local adaptations to bidding, scoring, and gameplay. The name 'Kontra' refers to the doubling mechanic common in Jass games.",
