          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Win tricks containing high-value cards. Partnership needs majority of points (typically 61+ of 120) to win the hand.',
          gameplay: "1. **Dealing**: Cards dealt to all players.\n2. **Bidding**: Players bid to determine trump suit or play special contracts.\n3. **Kontra**: Opponents may say 'Kontra' to double the stakes if they believe declarers will fail.\n4. **Trick Play**: Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may trump or discard.\n5. **Winning Tricks**: Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads to next trick.",
          keyRules: [
            'Must follow suit if possible; if void, may trump or discard.',
            'Trump Jack (Puur) is the highest card; trump 9 (Nell) is second highest in the game.',
            'Partnership with majority of card points (61+ of 120) wins the hand.',
            'Opponents may say Kontra to double the stakes if they believe the declaring side will fail.',
            "Player to dealer's left leads to the first trick; trick winner leads to the next.",
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'The trump Jack (20 points) and trump 9 (14 points) are the most powerful cards. Try to win tricks containing these. Count your high cards and plan accordingly.',
          intermediate: "Trump management is crucial. With many trumps, lead them early to draw out opponents' trumps. Save trumps for winning valuable tricks. Watch which cards have been played.",
          advanced: 'The Kontra decision is strategic. Call Kontra when you believe opponents have overbid or when you have strong defensive cards. Signal to your partner through lead choices. In trump selection, choose suits where you have length and strength.',
          tips: [
            'The trump Jack and 9 are extremely valuable - protect them and use them wisely.',
            'Communication with your partner through card play is essential.',
            'Consider carefully before calling Kontra - it doubles both rewards and penalties.',
            'Track which high cards have been played to calculate remaining winning cards.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
